# Strip .NET / Unity / IDE artifacts from `npm pack` tarballs and any tool
# that publishes the package. Unity-side artifacts in particular CANNOT
# ship inside a UPM package. Unity will try to load every .dll it finds
# inside Packages/ as a native plugin and crash on the duplicates.

# .NET build output
bin/
obj/
*.user
*.suo

# Unity-side outputs (when this dir is opened as a Unity project)
Library/
Temp/
Logs/
UserSettings/
Build/
Builds/

# Coverage
coverage/
TestResults/
*.coverage
*.coveragexml

# IDE
.vs/
.vscode/
.idea/

# OS
.DS_Store

# Local-only files
.git/
.github/
*.md.bak
